        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pineapple Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional Rope style appliance pull is finished with detailed Pineapples on both ends.  The Pineapple pull ends are <b>1\" Diameter</b> and <b>1-3/8\" high</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. Although this Appliance Pull is available in several lengths, we believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe pineapple handle is <b>1\" Diameter</b> with a <b>2-3/8\" Projection</b> and made of the high quality Brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This Pineapple pull is available in 4 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBP-9-PINE: Total Length 9\" - Center to Center Mount - 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBP-12-PINE: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount - 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBP-18-PINE: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBP-24-PINE: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 18\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pineapple appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick  refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pineapple Appliance Pull, First Impressions CFRBP-PINE",
                "description": "This traditional Rope style appliance pull is finished with detailed Pineapples on both ends.  Available in 9 different finish colors and 4 different lengths up to 24 inches. ",
